 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Starting as a Small Zombie, I Cultivate to Immortality by Growing Plants"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "开局一具小僵尸，修仙全靠种植物"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I crossed over, my gold finger became Plants vs Zombies and I’m the zombie… “Sunflowers produce one grain of sunlight a day and they also contain the qi of the entire body during the Qi Refining Period? With 54 squares planted, isn’t this…” “A pea from the Pea Shooter is comparable to a full strength blow from someone from the Qi Refining Stage?” “Oh my god, is this a Squash? A Great Foundation building master was killed in one sitting!” “This Nascent Soul Elder, this spirit plant I offered is called the Doom-Shroom…” “Eh? How come these two plants can be hybridized…” “Zombie illustrated book? Open it.” “The zombie body can be upgraded and different zombies can be replaced as the main body…quickly bring me the Dacheng Holy Body covered with green hair!”"
  },
